# Pairs with CaptureStrictIsolation. The staging emits a batch as soon as its
# prepares are complete, without asking the decision snapshot: a batch fully
# prepared but undecided at the increment, and aborted later, is restored.
MODULE: CaptureStrictIsolationIncrementIgnoresDecision
TARGET: CaptureStrictIsolation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a complete batch is emitted without consulting d0
PERTURBS: Drain

--- FIND
         ELSE [kind |-> "incr", heads |-> NewHeads, emit |-> Emit,
--- REPLACE
         \* MUTATION: completeness alone decides.
         ELSE [kind |-> "incr", heads |-> NewHeads,
               emit |-> IF ~AbortSeen /\ Complete THEN Keys ELSE {},
--- END
